### 1. Registrar
POST http://localhost:8000/api/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Saulo",
  "email": "saulo@teste.com",
  "password": "12345678",
  "password_confirmation": "12345678"
}

### 2. Listar entregas (precisa de token)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/entregas
Accept: application/json
Authorization: COLE_TOKEN_AQUI

### Login
POST http://localhost:8000/api/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "saulo@teste.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### Criar entrega
POST http://localhost:8000/api/entregas
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: COLE_TOKEN_AQUI

{
  "descricao": "Hambúrguer",
  "endereco_coleta": "Rua C, 30",
  "endereco_entrega": "Rua D, 40",
  "valor": 25.90
}